00:11:37.460 --> 00:11:39.370
But, there issues of accountability

00:11:39.370 --> 00:11:41.720
at stake when celebrities use their power

00:11:41.720 --> 00:11:43.530
to change our consumption habits.

00:11:43.530 --> 00:11:44.363
What was supposed

00:11:44.363 --> 00:11:47.390
to be a historically significant
